message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "bpfix-adversarial: controlled stress testing of eBPF diagnostic localization"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-07"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kazuru
    given-names: Seke
