    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Malawi"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kazuru-chidumbwe/bpfix-adversarial"
url: "https://github.com/kazuru-chidumbwe/bpfix-adversarial/tree/v1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Open-source harness for controlled stress testing of eBPF diagnostic
  localization: construction-time injection markers, pinned-lab verifier
  captures, and injection-site agreement scoring under pad and rename
  (PointerProvenance, ScalarRange, NullablePointer, PacketBounds). Does not
  claim a semantic proof-loss oracle.
keywords:
  - eBPF
  - verifier
  - diagnostic localization
  - metamorphic testing
  - bpfix
  - software testing
